title: "AutoMath: an agent workspace for research mathematics with sources, review, and Lean 4"
abstract: "A project template and tooling that let Claude Code or DeepSeek Harness agents carry a mathematical topic from sources and refereed ideas to a proof formalized in Lean 4 with fidelity checks and a LaTeX paper."
